# FileManager Provider

The FileManager provider enables comprehensive file and directory management with ACID guarantees, supporting multiple storage backends (local filesystem, SSH/SFTP, S3, Azure Blob, GCS, and more) and structured content formats (JSON, YAML, TOML, HCL, XML, INI).

## Features

- **ACID Guarantees** - Atomic writes, file locking, checksum verification for data integrity
- **Multiple Backends** - Local filesystem, SSH/SFTP, S3, Azure Blob Storage, Google Cloud Storage, Backblaze B2, FTP/FTPS, OpenStack Swift
- **Structured Content** - Native support for JSON, YAML, TOML, HCL, XML, INI, and ENV files with deep merge capabilities
- **Application Configs** - Pre-built templates for nginx, consul, prometheus, grafana, and other common applications
- **Zero-Copy Transfers** - Optimized file transfers using sendfile, splice, and copy_file_range

